<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Extracts martial and arcane essence from a pawn. This is a single use item that will permanently remove a pawn's class and convert it into essence. Essence may be consumed to grant class experience. The shard is destroyed after the extraction process.-->
  <AdministerShardOfExtraction.description>从小人中提取战斗或魔法的精华。这是一个不可逆的过程，将永久删除小人的职业，并将其转化为本质。本质可以被消耗以获得职业经验。碎片在提取后会销毁。</AdministerShardOfExtraction.description>
  <!--EN: Using Shard of Extraction-->
  <AdministerShardOfExtraction.jobString>使用灵魂提取碎片</AdministerShardOfExtraction.jobString>
  <!--EN: administer shard of extraction-->
  <AdministerShardOfExtraction.label>施行灵魂提取碎片</AdministerShardOfExtraction.label>
  <!--EN: Use {0_label}-->
  <MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.comps.2.useLabel>使用 {0_label}</MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.comps.2.useLabel>
  <!--EN: This scroll may be used to change the shaman's spirit animal. The new bond will randomly select a new spirit type to bond.-->
  <MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.description>这个卷轴可以用来改变精神契约。新的契约将随机选择一种新的守护之灵来绑定。</MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.description>
  <!--EN: Scroll of Spirit Binding-->
  <MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.label>精神绑定卷轴</MagicArtifact_RerollSpiritBond.label>
  <!--EN: Use {0_label}-->
  <TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.comps.2.useLabel>使用 {0_label}</TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.comps.2.useLabel>
  <!--EN: This mysterious shard is capable of extracting the martial or arcane talents of a pawn and converting it to essence. The shard is destroyed after use.
	
*Note: this item completely removes a pawn's class and any associated abilities and skills. The pawn may learn another class following a spirit extraction.-->
  <TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.description>这个神秘的碎片能够提取一个小人的战斗或魔法天赋并将其转化为“本质”。碎片使用后被销毁。\n*注意：这个碎片会完全删除一个小人的职业和任何相关的能力和技能。灵魂提取后,小人可以学习另一个职业。</TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.description>
  <!--EN: Shard of Spirit Extraction-->
  <TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.label>灵魂提取碎片</TM_Artifact_ClassExtraction.label>
  <!--EN: Use {0_label}-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.comps.0.useLabel>使用 {0_label}</TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.comps.0.useLabel>
  <!--EN: The essence of raw, magical skill. Absorbing the essence grants arcane experience.-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.description>原始魔法的本质。魔法技巧，吸取精华可获得魔法经验。</TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.description>
  <!--EN: Essence of Magic-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.label>魔法的本质</TM_MagicArtifact_MagicEssence.label>
  <!--EN: Use {0_label}-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.comps.0.useLabel>使用 {0_label}</TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.comps.0.useLabel>
  <!--EN: The essence of raw, martial skill. Absorbing the essence grants martial experience.-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.description>原始力量的本质。格斗技巧，吸取精华可获得战技经验。</TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.description>
  <!--EN: Essence of Might-->
  <TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.label>力量的本质</TM_MagicArtifact_MightEssence.label>
</LanguageData>
